  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "089d898170ac56ab",
      "translationZh": "Veo 3.1 Ingredients to Video：更强的一致性、创造力与控制力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8aaa4f6399e52d11",
      "translationZh": "我们最新的 Veo 更新可生成生动、富有动感的视频片段，自然且引人入胜，并支持竖屏视频生成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7063421752203a48",
      "translationZh": "Google DeepMind 首席产品经理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "您的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "此内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4823ace008d193de",
      "translationZh": "Veo 3.1 让您直接在手机上利用图像创作更具表现力的视频。现在，您可以为 YouTube Shorts 等平台生成竖屏视频，并将分辨率提升至 1080p 或 4K。在 Gemini 应用、YouTube Shorts、Flow、Gemini API、Vertex AI 和 Google Vids 中试用更新后的 Veo 3.1。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b43a10482221e5d",
      "translationZh": "摘要由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "01efcf125255552b",
      "translationZh": "“Veo 3.1 Ingredients to Video”迎来升级，助您创作更具创意、更高质量、以移动端为先的视频。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e2041709344f0f1b",
      "translationZh": "将图像转化为表现力更强的视频，呈现更丰富的对话，并保持角色和背景的一致性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "890106ac020e0db5",
      "translationZh": "Veo 3.1 现已支持原生竖屏（9:16）视频输出，适用于 YouTube Shorts 等平台。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e0698dbed070bb8a",
      "translationZh": "现已支持将视频提升至 1080p 和 4K 分辨率，让视频制作更清晰、保真度更高。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "99c6d8622abe31c3",
      "translationZh": "你可以在 Gemini 应用、YouTube、Flow、Google Vids、API 和 Vertex AI 中试用 Veo 3.1。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f344ef9188695765",
      "translationZh": "探索其他风格：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a64d78fdcdea8ca",
      "translationZh": "如今，Veo 的表现力更强了。通过这些改进，你可以基于素材图像，创作更有趣、更具创意且质量更高的视频，并且直接针对移动端格式进行制作。我们很高兴能为所有人带来全新的创作可能性，无论你是业余故事创作者，还是专业电影制作人。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bc89801115f62d9a",
      "translationZh": "改进 Veo 3.1 Ingredients to Video 功能，这项功能让你能够根据参考图像创建视频。此次更新让视频更具表现力和创意，即使使用简单的提示词也能如此",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e6ab5dc065d0f27e",
      "translationZh": "为 Ingredients to Video 提供原生竖屏输出（纵向模式），助力以移动端为先的短视频创作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "063752f679941526",
      "translationZh": "采用先进的画质提升技术，将分辨率提升至 1080p 和 4K 1，满足高保真制作工作流程的需求",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b42d7774b4447b7f",
      "translationZh": "无论你希望画面中的动作更生动、更好地控制视觉元素，还是获得达到广播级要求的分辨率，这些更新都能为你提供将创意变为现实的工具。这些更新正在 Gemini app、YouTube、Flow、Google Vids、Gemini API 和 Vertex AI 中推出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6cd09e3dda6f0090",
      "translationZh": "Veo 3.1 Ingredients to Video 的改进",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "17894b1cd8d12d21",
      "translationZh": "将素材图像转化为有趣、易于分享的短片",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ae1ece444cd765b",
      "translationZh": "即使提示词很简短，你也能基于素材图像生成动感十足、引人入胜的视频。现在，你会看到更丰富的对话和叙事，让视频更鲜活、更具表现力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "130bf24fb07022aa",
      "translationZh": "保持角色的身份一致性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "515b09cf3d545833",
      "translationZh": "Veo 3.1 Ingredients to Video 的身份一致性表现比以往更加出色。即使场景发生变化，也能让角色的外观保持一致，使同一个角色能够出现在多个场景中，从而更轻松地讲述完整的故事。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3c70823d6f17bf04",
      "translationZh": "实现背景与物体的一致性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c86ce5abdea23572",
      "translationZh": "通过保持场景环境及其中物体的完整性来掌控场景。你还可以跨场景重复使用物体、背景或纹理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c916209679194f10",
      "translationZh": "无缝融合纹理、角色和物体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25cec20ebc569f41",
      "translationZh": "将角色、物体、纹理和风格化背景等不同元素组合成一个协调统一、极具冲击力的视频片段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33adc2d5924d98c5",
      "translationZh": "专业技巧：在 Gemini 应用或 Flow 中使用全新的 Nano Banana Pro (Gemini 3 Pro Image) 创建素材图像，然后利用这些图像，通过 Veo 3.1 Ingredients to Video 创作令人惊艳的视频。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "95a8dca61d1bfcbf",
      "translationZh": "借助升级后的功能，打造高保真视觉效果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5e9be95a0036a29",
      "translationZh": "借助 Veo 3.1 的新功能，我们推出了针对移动端优化的输出，以及专业级画质选项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6d9624f4b90d6900",
      "translationZh": "Ingredients to Video 的原生竖屏输出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b261be435b00a5fc",
      "translationZh": "“Ingredients to Video”首次支持以原生 9:16 宽高比生成视频。无论你是为 YouTube Shorts 还是其他平台创作，现在都可以制作高质量的全屏竖屏叙事视频，无需裁剪，也不会损失画质。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "55100391645146de",
      "translationZh": "利用先进的超分辨率技术提升至 1080p 和 4K 分辨率",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1306fa3e60b845d",
      "translationZh": "利用先进的超分辨率技术生成 1080p 和 4K 视频。我们改进后的 1080p 分辨率可提供更锐利、更干净的视频画面，非常适合编辑。如果需要更多细节，可以选择 4K，以捕捉丰富的纹理和惊人的清晰度——非常适合高端制作和大屏幕展示。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a6823ad328847de1",
      "translationZh": "立即体验这些更新",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f99fee24aefef083",
      "translationZh": "现在，你可以在我们的各项产品和服务中使用这些适配你工作流程的新功能：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6bdd4a52c070ed96",
      "translationZh": "消费者和创作者：我们首次将 Veo 3.1 Ingredients to Video 直接引入 YouTube Shorts 和 YouTube Create 应用。从今天起，你还可以在 Gemini 应用中体验增强版 Veo 3.1 Ingredients to Video 以及 Veo 的竖屏模式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9cca3ee1906dd726",
      "translationZh": "专业和企业工作流程：增强版 Veo 3.1 Ingredients to Video 和原生竖屏格式支持正陆续在 Flow、Gemini API、Vertex AI 和 Google Vids 上推出，Flow、API 和 Vertex AI 也提供 1080p 和 4K 分辨率选项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "64cf1ff71fe3d39f",
      "translationZh": "在 Gemini 应用中验证视频",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8305a155b2e996e2",
      "translationZh": "我们致力于提供工具，让人们更容易判断内容是否由 AI 生成。因此，Google 工具生成的视频都嵌入了我们无法被感知的 SynthID 数字水印。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee379d984f840d89",
      "translationZh": "12 月，我们扩展了 Gemini 应用中强大的验证工具，使其支持视频。现在，你可以上传一段视频，直接询问它是否由 Google AI 生成。这是在我们现有图像验证工具基础上的进一步拓展，有助于为所有人打造更加透明的生态系统。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d31ef26c85e61e3",
      "translationZh": "你可以阅读我们的博文，进一步了解我们如何通过 SynthID 提高 AI 内容的透明度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1be4f93954ffc19",
      "translationZh": "仅在 Flow、Gemini API 和 Vertex AI 中支持将分辨率提升至 1080p 和 4K",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fefef2f9c6cb957b",
      "translationZh": "我们在 2026 年 9 月公布的最新 AI 动态",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4f32c94e810121bc",
      "translationZh": "观看 Future Vision XPRIZE 获奖预告片《The Gifted》。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "717d7c74d523f088",
      "translationZh": "Google Beam 拓展至新地区，并迎来新的合作伙伴和客户",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3070dbe5b762a2c7",
      "translationZh": "新专家加入 Google 的 AI 与经济团队",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64df1b9e4b2e1f94",
      "translationZh": "作者：Scott Strand 和 Zanna Iscenko",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4c80964dec505111",
      "translationZh": "与 Google 共同创造时尚的未来",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4a889d2a4288b1f9",
      "translationZh": "让全球数据更易于探索",
